                        "sense_id": "a4e99f9b-30af-37ba-8fc6-ebafbfe5f0af",
                        "entry_id": "4f2cf9fe-8963-30a8-907c-6c79f153e5df",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Manipulation par les pieds."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "520c85d5-52be-482d-b480-0a7ff862f184",
                                "sense_id": "a4e99f9b-30af-37ba-8fc6-ebafbfe5f0af",
                                "text": "Durant ce pétrissage ou cette pédipulation, on y ajoute environ un sixième de sable sec, très-fin, et qu'on a tamisé avec soin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1e1f80b8-a7a6-4501-8513-c5a25e86462d",
                                "sense_id": "a4e99f9b-30af-37ba-8fc6-ebafbfe5f0af",
                                "text": "Durant les phases offensives, les actions consistent à conserver le ballon, progresser vers la cible ou tirer.\nDurant les phases défensives, elles consistent à récupérer le ballon, empêcher progression et empêcher de tirer. Le tout dans un contexte singulier de pédipulation d’un engin, le ballon. Dès lors, les choix réalisés par les élèves se réalisent dans cette perspective. Le porteur de balle est confronté systématiquement à des choix multiples : dribble/passe/tir."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "815fd2a9-c42f-4de4-b20b-59aa8d544728",
                        "source_entry_id": "4f2cf9fe-8963-30a8-907c-6c79f153e5df",
                        "source_sense_id": "a4e99f9b-30af-37ba-8fc6-ebafbfe5f0af",
                        "target_lang_word": "pedipulation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pedipulation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "07e8738a-b0de-33c1-a24c-ed572e6ee3cb",
                                        "entry_id": "7ca3a229-8ccf-3649-b057-ed3949e499a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dexterous manipulation of objects using the feet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20326bf4-983d-47d6-8b46-8f2aa7231af2",
                                                "sense_id": "07e8738a-b0de-33c1-a24c-ed572e6ee3cb",
                                                "text": "It is a rather amusing sight to see the native and his \"lubra,\" or wife. . . . [T]heir remarkable power of pedipulation is a serviceable agent to them, for any small article which excites their cupidity they can take up with the toe, pass it up the back, and then conceal it in the girdle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27576892-1697-4f1e-945d-92361fd0cbc6",
                                                "sense_id": "07e8738a-b0de-33c1-a24c-ed572e6ee3cb",
                                                "text": "We understand that this clutch can be slipped to the uttermost by pedipulation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd217b68-37db-41d9-ae06-e20e0c1830b4",
                                                "sense_id": "07e8738a-b0de-33c1-a24c-ed572e6ee3cb",
                                                "text": "If ever they attempt a revival of their trade, they would do well to photograph beauties in shorts pumping away, with the unmistakable inference that such pulchritude and shapeliness were the results of diligent pedipulation of the player piano."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "521143e2-65a5-4983-a057-54118fcc59d8",
                                                "sense_id": "07e8738a-b0de-33c1-a24c-ed572e6ee3cb",
                                                "text": "A completely stepwise online pedipulation planning method is proposed . . . based on the general solution of the equation of motion of an approximate dynamical biped model whose mass is concentrated at the center of mass."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8aa4e26d-f697-35fb-b412-1cb34391858c",
                                        "entry_id": "7ca3a229-8ccf-3649-b057-ed3949e499a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of such manipulation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "rare",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9850bfe4-9fb6-4948-a2ca-2ffbed5dd346",
                                                "sense_id": "8aa4e26d-f697-35fb-b412-1cb34391858c",
                                                "text": "At their turning-lathes, they employ their toes to guide the chisel; and, in these pedipulations, shew to Europeans a diverting degree of address."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f7cf1ee-e041-45af-b658-52ba0665a86d",
                                                "sense_id": "8aa4e26d-f697-35fb-b412-1cb34391858c",
                                                "text": "He had put his feet out on the floor and was feeling for his slippers with blind pedipulations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
